L55: push_constant_string "To modify the spell so that it goes to our chosen destination, you must connect the "
L56: push_constant_string "<col=ff0000>"
L57: push_constant_string "start node"
L58: push_constant_string "</col>"
L59: push_constant_string " at the bottom to the "
